        {
          "start": 312,
          "end": 315,
          "text": "## add_modifier\nAdds a timed modifier effect to object in scope\n**Supported Scopes**: country, building, character, institution, interest_group, journal_entry, political_movement, power_bloc, state  \n"
        },
        {
          "start": 1124,
          "end": 1128,
          "text": "\n## custom_tooltip\njust a tooltip, the scope as subject (for grouping, localization).  \ncustom_tooltip = key; alternatively custom_tooltip = { text = key subject = scope (optional) <hidden effects> }\n**Supported Scopes**: none  "
        },
        {
          "start": 37209,
          "end": 37212,
          "text": "## show_as_tooltip\nEnclosed effects are only shown in tooltips (but are not actually executed)  \nshow_as_tooltip = { <more effects> }\n**Supported Scopes**: none  "
        }
      ]
    }
